<div class="aw-page-head"><div><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] font-extrabold text-indigo-300">Your license vault</div><h1 class="aw-title mt-2">My Keys</h1><p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mt-1">All keys generated or purchased by your account in one place.</p></div><div class="flex gap-2"><a href="generate" class="aw-copyall"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-2"></i>Generate Keys</a><button class="aw-copyall" type="button" onclick="copyAllKeys()"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy mr-2"></i>Copy All</button></div></div>
